<!-- F05 / §3.2 角色卡:支持可折叠常驻顶栏、展示真实搭档角色名 + 搭档走散全量逃生舱 -->
<view wx:if="{{card}}" class="rc {{card.mode === 'solo' ? 'rc--solo' : ''}} {{collapsible ? 'rc--bar' : ''}} {{collapsible && collapsed ? 'rc--folded' : ''}}" aria-role="region" aria-label="{{card.heading || '角色信息'}}">
  <view wx:if="{{collapsible}}" class="rc__bar" bindtap="toggleCollapse" aria-role="button" aria-expanded="{{!collapsed}}" aria-label="{{card.heading || '角色线索'}}，{{collapsed ? '展开' : '收起'}}" hover-class="cy-pressed" hover-stay-time="80">
    <view class="rc__head">{{card.heading || '全量角色线索'}}</view>
    <text class="rc__toggle">{{collapsed ? '展开线索' : '收起'}}</text>
  </view>
  <view wx:elif="{{card.heading}}" class="rc__head">{{card.heading}}</view>
  <block wx:if="{{!collapsible || !collapsed}}">
    <view wx:for="{{card.sections}}" wx:key="k" class="rc__sec">
      <view wx:if="{{item.label}}" class="rc__label">{{item.label}}</view>
      <view wx:if="{{item.title}}" class="rc__title">{{item.title}}</view>
      <text wx:if="{{item.body}}" class="rc__body" user-select>{{item.body}}</text>
      <view wx:for="{{item.items}}" wx:for-item="row" wx:key="k" class="rc__item">
        <text wx:if="{{row.label}}" class="rc__item-k">{{row.label}}</text>
        <text class="rc__item-v" user-select>{{row.text}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{card.otherRoleLabel}}" class="rc__foot">{{card.partnerLine}}</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{card.footer}}" class="rc__foot">{{card.footer}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{card.mode === 'team'}}" class="rc__escape" catchtap="onEscapeSolo" aria-role="button" aria-label="{{card.escapeLabel}}" hover-class="cy-pressed" hover-stay-time="80">{{card.escapeLabel}}</view>
  </block>
</view>
